### 查询所有笔记
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notes

### 新增笔记
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "第二篇笔记：测试新增"
}

### 修改笔记
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/notes/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "第二篇笔记：已修改"
}

### 删除笔记
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/notes/2
### 用户注册
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "peng4",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 用户登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "peng4",
  "password": "123456"
}
### 新增笔记（带 userId）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
userId: 1

{
  "content": "用户的笔记2"
}

### 修改笔记（自己改自己的）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/notes/53
Content-Type: application/json
userId: 1

{
  "content": "修改的内容"
}

### 删除笔记（不是自己的，应该失败）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/notes/52
userId: 1
### 查询 id=52 的笔记（测缓存）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notes/52